[24.642175, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[24.642236, "o", "   2. The filter string will be passed as the jq filter expression\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[24.642242, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[24.642322, "o", "   3. The input file '\"'\"'/app/users.json'\"'\"' is fixed and will be used as input\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[24.642389, "o", "   4. The output will be redirected to '\"'\"'/app/active_users_report.json'\"'\"'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[24.642417, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[24.642454, "o", "   5. jq will be executed exactly once with all these components\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
